      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd love a feature where I can choose who can and can not interact with me physically. It would save me from having to run around the world trying to avoid that one person who just doesn't understand basic socal cues. VRChat definitely has an issue with non consentual touching and it needs to stop.",
