      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To clarify a bit\n\ni want to add onto the already existing feature with the option to select who\n\nthis would be client side only with our personal settings and wouldnt effect anyone around us\n\nsome people are non confrontational, alot of people dont like to cause drama by blocking cuz it just creates an akward and unhealthy environment\n\nIt should just be normalized to not touch someone without consent but i thought this change could help both parties",
