      "value": "I've been saying this for well over a year amongst friends. But a feature like this is desperately needed. Folks in VRChat usually either get really upset or disgusting when someone says they don't like strangers touching them, especially if its for phantom sense reasons. \n\nI cannot count the amount of times over my time spent in VRChat that I've sexually harassed by strangers because I said \"Please don't touch me, especially my face. Got a lil too much phantom sense.\"",
